{"id":"acheteur","lemma":"acheteur","pos":"noun","rank":4074,"glosses":["buyer, purchaser (person who makes purchases)"],"ipa":"/aʃ.tœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1d/Fr-acheteur.ogg/Fr-acheteur.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"acheteurs","feminine":"acheteuse"},"formAudio":{"acheteurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-acheteurs.wav","acheteuse":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-acheteuse.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai trouvé un acheteur.","en":"I've found a buyer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'ai trouvé un acheteur pour votre maison.","en":"I found a buyer for your house.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"J'ai déjà un acheteur sur les rangs.","en":"I've already got a buyer lined up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"already, before"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"row or line of things…","l":"rang"}]},{"text":"Son travail consiste à négocier avec les acheteurs étrangers.","en":"His job is to negotiate with foreign buyers.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"to consist","l":"consister"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to negotiate"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"foreigner","l":"étranger"}]},{"text":"Ils n'ont toujours pas trouvé d'acheteur pour cette maison.","en":"They still haven't found a buyer for that house.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"house, home"}]}]}